  m_Name: SocialHearMore02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hearMoreName: SocialHearMore02
  hearMoreText: "Algorithmic decisions can deeply impact people\u2019s lives, so
    fairness and transparency are essential parts of sustainable software. Biased
    data or untested assumptions can silently exclude groups or reinforce discrimination.
    Sustainable design means actively auditing datasets, explaining decision logic,
    and including diverse perspectives during development \u2014 ensuring technology
    supports equity rather than amplifying inequality."
